---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
// Keep inline tags on one line with outer spaces (Astro whitespace).
// Never break before <em>/<strong>/<a> after a word: newline alone is stripped.
// No em-dashes in public copy.
---

<Layout title="Living Identity | Identity Engineering">
	<main>
		<section class="min-h-[50vh] flex flex-col justify-center pt-28 pb-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40 mb-6">Framework · Layer 04</div>
				<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tighter leading-[0.95] mb-6 text-white">
					Living Identity
				</h1>
				<p class="text-xl text-white/50 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
					Operational scaffold under the geometric concepts.
					Geometry describes the shape of identity space.
					Living Identity describes how that geometry is metabolized through continuous Interaction.
				</p>
				<div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/[0.04] p-4">
					<p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed">
						<strong class="text-white/80">Status:</strong> Working scaffold.
						Not a claim of new natural-science laws. Cell biology is the primary biological reading.
						Analogy, not isomorphism. Biology lens: Single and Interactive complete; Collective next.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Biology lens</h2>
				<p>
					Same scale structure as physics (Single · Interactive · Collective), founded concept by concept from biology.
				</p>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-white/85">Single:</strong>
					<a href="/framework/gene" class="text-white/90 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Gene</a>
					→
					<a href="/framework/boundary" class="text-white/90 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Boundary</a>
					→
					<a href="/framework/cell" class="text-white/90 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Cell</a>
					→
					<a href="/framework/metabolism" class="text-white/90 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Metabolism</a>.
				</p>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-white/85">Interactive:</strong>
					<a href="/framework/signal" class="text-white/90 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Signal</a>
					→
					<a href="/framework/recognition" class="text-white/90 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Recognition</a>
					→
					<a href="/framework/coupling" class="text-white/90 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Coupling</a>.
				</p>
				<p class="text-white/45">
					<strong class="text-white/60">Collective (next):</strong> Multicellularity → Specialization → Regulation.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Climax of the map</h2>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-white/80">01 Single · 02 Interactive · 03 Collective</strong>
					under two science lenses (physics and biology), plus this operational living scaffold.
				</p>
				<p>
					Physics describes the scales geometrically. Biology describes them as living form.
					This page remains the metabolic / operational question:
					<em class="text-white/75">how does that geometry live?</em>
				</p>
				<p>
					The <a href="/os" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">OS</a> operationalizes the usable system.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-8">Life (IE operational definition)</h2>
				<ol class="space-y-4 text-white/65 leading-relaxed list-decimal list-inside">
					<li><strong class="text-white/85">Boundary</strong>: Surface / Jurisdiction maintained.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-white/85">Metabolism</strong>: Interaction continuously becomes relative geometry.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-white/85">Continuity</strong>: Stem recognizability across updates.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-white/85">Causal Entropy under constraint</strong>: option space expands without dissolving the boundary.</li>
				</ol>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Cell biology map</h2>
				<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
					<table class="w-full text-left text-sm text-white/65">
						<thead class="border-b border-white/10 text-white/40">
							<tr>
								<th class="p-3 font-medium">Biology</th>
								<th class="p-3 font-medium">IE page</th>
							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody class="divide-y divide-white/10">
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Heritable information (genetics)</td>
								<td class="p-3"><a href="/framework/gene" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Gene</a></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Plasma membrane</td>
								<td class="p-3"><a href="/framework/boundary" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Boundary</a></td>
							</tr>
														<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Cell as unit of life</td>
								<td class="p-3"><a href="/framework/cell" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Cell</a></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Metabolism (transform input → maintain form)</td>
															<td class="p-3"><a href="/framework/metabolism" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Metabolism</a>: process of the Cell; Interaction → Geometry Receipt (local); Tensor / Registry feed is ongoing OS work</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Intercellular signaling</td>
															<td class="p-3"><a href="/framework/signal" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Signal</a>: elementary exchange event; OS Interaction Signal; tools, APIs, MCPs, scripts (Interactive scale next)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Internal processing without outbound signal</td>
								<td class="p-3">Think phase (substrate + prompts; not an IE isolation runtime)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Directed marking / maturation of the Bauplan</td>
								<td class="p-3">Mature: causal integration record; optional Ownership claim on the receipt</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Nucleus + gene expression machinery</td>
								<td class="p-3">Agentic loop as optional machinery <em>inside</em> the form (not the Identity)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Cytoplasm / working medium</td>
								<td class="p-3">Local runtime context under the Surface</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Homeostasis</td>
								<td class="p-3">Damping + continuity of Stem under update</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Receptor / self–non-self discrimination</td>
								<td class="p-3"><a href="/framework/recognition" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Recognition</a></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Junctions / adhesion</td>
								<td class="p-3"><a href="/framework/coupling" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Coupling</a></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="p-3">Multicellular organism</td>
								<td class="p-3">Organism lens on Emergence / Damping</td>
							</tr>
						</tbody>
					</table>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-6"><strong class="text-white/85">Identity ≠ agentic loop.</strong></p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Concepts of this scaffold</h2>

				<article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-6">
					<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[3px] text-white/35 mb-2">01 · Boundary</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Membrane of the form</h3>
					<p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
														Protected interior every Identity needs. Surface, consent, foreign-estimate zone.
														An inward phase (Think) requires this space; the protection itself is substrate-provided (plan-mode, private memory, human silence, chip policy), not an IE chat runtime.
						Full biology-lens page:
						<a href="/framework/boundary" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Boundary</a>.
					</p>
				</article>

				<article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-6">
					<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[3px] text-white/35 mb-2">02 · Metabolism</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Interaction → geometry</h3>
					<p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
						Continuous conversion of Interaction into relative geometry. Probes-as-Bridge, not a separate tool shelf.
						Full biology-lens page:
						<a href="/framework/metabolism" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Metabolism</a>.
					</p>
				</article>

														<article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-6">
					<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[3px] text-white/35 mb-2">03 · TIM Cycle</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Think · Interact · Mature</h3>
					<p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-4">
						<strong class="text-white/80">Practice-validated postulate</strong>: phases of Interaction relative to the membrane,
						proven useful in agentic digital-identity practice; not claimed as geometric law.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-3 text-white/60 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside">
						<li><strong class="text-white/80">Think</strong>: inside; non-emitting phase label. Isolation is substrate + prompts. IE does not ship a Think CLI; evaluating and writing geometry is Mature.</li>
						<li><strong class="text-white/80">Interact</strong>: across; signals, tools, APIs, CLIs, MCPs, deterministic scripts. Maximal coupling to reality under Surface policy.</li>
						<li><strong class="text-white/80">Mature</strong>: inside, directed; causal integration of the Trajectory into a Geometry Receipt. Optional ownership_move is a claim record only. Bridges Causal Entropy to Stem continuity under Ownership.</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-6">
					<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[3px] text-white/35 mb-2">04 · Organism</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Living collective</h3>
					<p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
						Organism-scale cell biology (tissue → organ → organism) reads Emergence and Damping as a living system:
						specialization, multi-speed regulation, shared context. Geometric Emergence remains the skeleton;
						this is the living-operation lens. Regulatory agent modules stay out until Framework-derived.
					</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
					<a href="/framework/gene" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-sm text-white/70 hover:bg-white/5 transition">Gene</a>
					<a href="/framework/cell" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-sm text-white/70 hover:bg-white/5 transition">Cell</a>
					<a href="/framework/signal" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-sm text-white/70 hover:bg-white/5 transition">Signal</a>
					<a href="/framework/coupling" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white text-black text-sm font-medium hover:bg-white/90 transition">Coupling</a>
					<a href="/framework" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-sm text-white/70 hover:bg-white/5 transition">Framework</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
